    "object": "Alibaba’s Qwen team has released Qwen-Image-2.1 , a unified text-to-image generation and image editing model. Its visual generation component has 7B parameters across 32 single-stream DiT layers. One checkpoint covers text-to-image, multi-reference editing, local edits, and transparent RGBA output.",
