    "source_refs": [
      "SA-0967b7c29c88f533"
    ]
  },
  {
    "relationship_id": "REL-63ab91837b94eeac",
    "event_id": "EV-a1c1e9084f310dba",
    "subject": "Meta’s Muse is outpacing ChatGPT’s early mobile",
    "predicate": "product_release",
    "object": "Until now, it had been difficult to make an exact apples-to-apples comparison between these two apps, given that they had pursued different launch strategies. When ChatGPT arrived on mobile, it was made available globally, but only on iOS. Muse, meanwhile, is available across both Apple’s App Store and Google Play, but only in the U.S. and Canada.",
    "claim_ref": "CL-36a083b312945bb9",
    "source_refs": [
      "SA-0967b7c29c88f533"
    ]
  },
  {
    "relationship_id": "REL-f82f301421585708",
    "event_id": "EV-a1c1e9084f310dba",
    "subject": "Meta’s Muse is outpacing ChatGPT’s early mobile",
    "predicate": "product_release",
    "object": "To better align the numbers for comparison, Apptopia looked only at the iOS data for the U.S. and Canada for both apps during the first 12 days of their respective launches. In this subset of the data, Muse has now seen 1.8 million downloads to ChatGPT’s 1.3 million.",
    "claim_ref": "CL-877c41bc9de943a4",
    "source_refs": [
